;    1: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=16, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1029, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=22, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=22, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=36, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=424, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=くぐつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=309, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=2969, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=2762, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We changed our original plan and decided to read a few promising books here in the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's because meeting up with <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> right now is dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a chance <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is watching me through the precognitives.<PG>
The promising books had already been picked out, and <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> was reading through them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The book <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had singled out seemed to have been written about 70 years ago: a report on the Droga human experiments.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was as much as I knew.<PG>
Only <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> was going through the books. I wasn't doing a thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason I wasn't doing anything was that the audio from earlier had been too much of a shock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> never knew <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="5">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So part of her can write it off as someone else's problem―
{PAUSE ""}
In a situation like this, that's worth a great deal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because it keeps her from ending up like me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE>, whom I'd loved so much, and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>, who'd been like a goddess, had teamed up and carried <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That alone had crushed my spirit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my head, I know. This is <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s doing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> probably didn't do it because they wanted to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... even so...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you okay? I've mostly finished reading over here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... What'd you find?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mostly what we expected. A religious group calling itself the Holy Cerejeira Church came to this land of Arata to research Droga, and carried off every cherry tree except the Niimura main house's. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In exchange, the Grand Witch of the settlement at the time asked them to disclose the research report."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"They did succeed in making Droga, but its side effects were so severe that in the end it was apparently never put to practical use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The side effects: when the user's blood touches the mucous membranes of someone's head, that person gains precognition, or falls into depression. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And since muscle control is difficult, there were apparently many cases of serious injury or death."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"So that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> looked up how to make it here and used Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">And that's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"This Droga seems to change its effects with each generation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Uh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, should we leave this for later?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah, do that... I can't concentrate on it right now..."</STYLE><PG>
I don't really get the logic, but if <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> has grounds she's satisfied with, that's good enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What matters to me, more than the logic, is what to do about <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And who I'm up against is the pair who've become <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="くぐつ">puppets</STYLE>: <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
The shock had settled down somewhat, but what remained in my heart was a sense of helplessness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a case like this, what is there that I can even do?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... where do you think </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was taken?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Where...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hmm, I don't know the geography around here, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please don't get any funny ideas, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Like charging straight in to wherever </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE><PG>
If I was helpless, I wanted to do whatever I could by brute force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was what <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> had seen right through―going to wherever <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know Arata's geography a little, but not well enough to pin down where <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, the whole settlement is out searching, and they still can't find her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know it's a reckless idea, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, is there an underground space in this settlement?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　A cave, for example."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, never heard of one... Why?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"About 450 years ago, the residents of this settlement killed one another. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The last to die then was a girl named Tomi. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">After her death, her body was preserved as a mummy, they say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Where's that mummy? Is that what you're getting at?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. If you wanted to preserve something like that with the techniques of the old days, it would be in a cave or an underground space where the temperature stays the same all year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Somewhere in this settlement there should be a place that sunlight, wind and other living things have a hard time getting into. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> don't know about it either, and a cave like that might be just as convenient for hiding </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Just because I don't know about it doesn't mean nobody else does.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I'd never even heard of any mummy till now, either..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"They may have searched the cave, but it is doubtful they searched as far as where the mummy is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Apparently the mummy was used as a ritual implement in the old days, but if </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> don't know about it, that means it hasn't been used for a long time, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　In that case, the mummy is somewhere very hard to find. In other words, it may be well suited to hiding </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm, a secret place like a cave... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Is there anywhere like that...?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"I know that place!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice rang out of nowhere, and my whole body jerked.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, long time no see!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Um, so this is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Nice to meet you! I'm Kana Niimura, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> cousin!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　And my type of guy is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> launched into a cheery self-introduction that didn't fit the mood at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, nice to meet you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> seemed thrown by <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE>'s energy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"So what are you doing in a place like this? I sensed someone in here, so I came to take a look."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, just doing some research. We figured we'd go back over what </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was looking into."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hmm. So, find anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I really tell <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> what we found?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stole a glance at <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, do you have a strange power, by any chance?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Like seeing things in the future..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course. If <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> has already had her first period, everything goes straight through to <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Nope, I don't have any powers like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> did, apparently!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> was safe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Listen, I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might be somewhere like a cave. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you said a minute ago that you knew one, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yeah! I know one!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Actually, I only found out today. There's a cave under my secret base!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right...! Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, could you show us the way there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Sure, but we already searched there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then, um... do you know about mummies?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Mummies?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　The ones in the pyramids, all wrapped up in bandages?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, well, pretty much..."</STYLE><PG>
A place where you could hide a mummy―if there's a place nobody has set foot in for a long time...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might be a wasted trip, but should we check it out...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please go with </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. I'll keep looking into things here a little longer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, no, come with us. Being alone is dangerous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is strong in the regular sense."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, the danger is being with a precognitive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As long as I'm alone, I'm safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, that's true enough, but... this is where <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was kidnapped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I really can't leave <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> on her own...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, is </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> back already?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yeah, they've already called off today's search."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, actually, you stay here with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I'll ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> to show me the cave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Just to be safe, in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I know already. I won't say anything I shouldn't."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------